<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.79 vs   2.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.48 vs   2.72</p>
<p> Operating profit    -1.70 vs  -1.78</p>
<p> Sales		    7.61 vs   8.46</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.21 vs  10.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	22.34 vs  10.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.21 vs  -4.38</p>
<p> Sales		   94.93 vs  92.23</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading company is Universal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
